        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.example.org/muac/ontology/local-moo#Structural_Element"/>
        <rdfs:comment>This will be constrained in the class with min 2, transitive does not work with that constraint. To not loose the transitive part  that rolls up from lowest level till its highest level, this is created as a child but with Assymetric &amp; Irreflexive. The isDirectPartOf is expected to roll up due to the parent. Should then onlu this type of link be used??</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


